WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
Disease sweeps through a wood,
and most of the rabbits die.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.150
In this wood, rabbits eat only grass.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.890
They don't eat oak trees.

4
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.950
So will losing the rabbits
change anything for the oak

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.830
seedlings?

6
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.770
Or are the oaks safe?

7
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.150
To find out, you need
to know who eats whom.

8
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.690
In this mission, you'll meet
producers and consumers.

9
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:23.350
You'll read the arrows
in a food chain,

10
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.530
and watch predator and prey
numbers rise and fall.

11
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.630
Then you'll join food
chains into a food web.

12
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.070
Your mission: work out what
rabbits have to do with oak trees.
